{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"5006004050010","name":"雛菜","text":"ね、どうしよう\r\nもう終わっちゃうけど～？","trans":"呐，怎么办\n已经要结束了哦～？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050030","name":"透","text":"やるか\r\nもう一回","trans":"来吗\n再来一次","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050050","name":"円香","text":"じゃ、みなさん入場からやり直しってことで","trans":"那就，大家从入场开始重来一遍","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050070","name":"小糸","text":"で、でも……\r\n今日がちゃんと終わらないと","trans":"可、可是……\n今天不好好结束的话","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050080","name":"小糸","text":"次が……\r\n始まらないよね……？","trans":"下一次……\n就没法开始了吧……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050100","name":"透","text":"始める","trans":"会开始的","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050110","name":"雛菜","text":"あは～！\r\n雛菜、次のライブでしたいこともう考えてる！","trans":"啊哈～！\n雏菜已经在想下次演出要做的事了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050120","name":"円香","text":"それなら、まずは終わろう","trans":"那就先结束吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050130","name":"円香","text":"……今日をちゃんと","trans":"……好好地把今天","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050140","name":"透","text":"──本日は\r\n…………せーの","trans":"——今天\n…………一、二","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"5006004050141","name":"一同","text":"────ありがとうございました……！","trans":"——非常感谢大家……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}